BASELINE remeasured live on a clean tree, reproduces v3 to the digit: real 137, insns T190/O191, multiset 7t, FRESH fuzzy 93.0158. v3's state assumptions therefore all hold four runs later and were NOT taken on trust.

THE ALIGNED VIEW FIRST, buildless, `fnasm game/sys/memcard writeGauntletSave 0x1a8:0x1f4 --diff`. This narrows v3's residual prose to one mechanism and is worth quoting because v3 did not print it: we ALREADY HAVE both halves of the guard. Ours 0x1b8 `addic. r7,r25,-23992` pairs with target 0x1b4 `addic. r6,r31,-23992`, and ours 0x1d0 `beq ->1e8` pairs with target 0x1d4 `beq ->1e8`. The ONLY missing piece is the loop lowering: target 0x1c0 `mtctr r6` + 0x1e4 `bdnz ->1d8` against our 0x1d8 `addic. r7,r7,-1` + 0x1e4 `bne ->1d4`. So the gap is not 'the guard versus the CTR loop' as a trade; the guard is won and only the CTR conversion is outstanding.

W1 (REVERTED - v3's MANDATORY STEP 1, executed and ANSWERED). Literal edit, replacing the loop body inside the retained guard:
    if ((count = big - 23992) != 0) {
        s32 n = count;
        do {
            sum += *q++;
        } while (--n);
    }
MEASURED: real 137 -> 150, insns T190/O191 -> T190/O192, multiset 7t -> 8t, new token ours-only -1 mr. probe.py additionally raised the DATA alarm 'non-text section(s) extabindex MOVED'.

WHY IT FAILS, named rather than shrugged at: the fresh local does NOT become the CTR counter. MWCC emits the seed `n = count` as a real `mr` and then decrements n in a GPR exactly as it decremented count before, so the edit BUYS a copy and SELLS nothing - the mtctr/bdnz pair never appears. The second induction variable is not privileged by the allocator; it is just a third live value in a region that already had two.

THIS IS THE PARK CONDITION v3 PRE-REGISTERED, quoted verbatim from its hypothesis.cheapest_refuting_observation: 'One probe. If the second-induction-variable form still emits an extra cmpwi/beq pair (insns O192 like P5) or loses the addic., the pair really is mutually exclusive under this pragma scaffold and the function should be parked at the committed 137 with the CTR row recorded as pragma-blocked.' W1 lands on the first disjunct exactly - insns O192, like P5. The axis is closed on the predecessor's own stated terms.
